Check the sampler started by this server, independently of other tests.

Telemetry.close signals asynchronous shutdown.  An older sampler may exit
between the global thread counts; compare thread identities and join the
new sampler to keep the lifecycle assertion without that race.
https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/blob/v0.1.45/serve/test_responses.py

